                            gen "Well, at least they were thorough." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
                            lun "Oh, you haven’t heard the best part. I *tried* to actually do some cleaning, but as soon as I bent down to pick up some debris—SPLASH! They *dived in* like a pod of overexcited dolphins, cleaning *everything* before I even touched it!" ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            gen "So you’re saying they cleaned the whole lake *for* you?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
                            lun "*Yes!* I was practically decorative!" ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            gen "And yet... you still look upset." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
                            lun "Because *right as they were finishing up*, one of them tried to show off by casting an overpowered *Aguamenti* spell." ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            # *She exhales sharply.*  
                            lun "Do you know what happens when a high-pressure water jet *hits someone wearing a string bikini*?" ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            # *The Genie blinks.*  
                            gen "...Oh no." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
