                            # *The Genie struggles to hold back laughter.*  
                            gen "And what did your new fisherman friends do?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
                            lun "Oh, they *helped*, of course! One of them immediately transfigured a fish into a towel. Another one *blindfolded himself* out of respect. And the third? He offered me *his robe*, but not before dramatically twirling it around like some kind of dueling champion!" ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            # *The Genie bursts out laughing.*  
                            gen "You have to admit, that’s some serious chivalry." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
                            lun @ cheeks blush"I don’t need *chivalry*, I need a lake that doesn’t conspire against me!" ("angry", "closed", "angry", "mid")  
                            gen "Well, at least you got paid?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  
